description: "Upgrade the pm CLI/SDK peer and development contract plus pm-changelog tooling to 2026.8.7, install the current extension-asset merge fence, revalidate the already-merged output_format decline behavior through the real SDK harness and a fresh installed-CLI tracker, and close stale issue pm-starter-ejr6 with current evidence."
