resolution: "Aligned dependency and merge contracts, removed explicit unsafe test annotations/dynamic imports, closed the released service regression with current evidence, and recorded all independent blockers."
expected_result: "pm-starter demonstrates pm 2026.8.7, preserves native output behavior, passes exact npm/Bun gates and fresh packed acceptance, and exposes unresolved release blockers honestly."
actual_result: "All tranche behavior and review criteria passed; source-quality, legacy PM metadata, and reachable-history privacy remain separately open and publication stays unapproved."
